cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this is useful in your work, we would appreciate a citation."
type: software
title: "mojolearn: GPU oblivious gradient-boosted trees in Mojo"
authors:
  - family-names: Hendel
    given-names: Andrew
    alias: ajhendel
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A port of CatBoost's GPU oblivious (symmetric) tree learner into Mojo,
  targeting Apple Silicon via Metal first, with CUDA and ROCm from the same
  source. The tree-growing algorithm is CatBoost's; see NOTICE and
  PORTED_MAP.tsv for what derives from their work and what does not.
keywords:
  - gradient boosting
  - oblivious trees
  - symmetric trees
  - GPU
  - Metal
  - Apple Silicon
  - Mojo
